From 0a563360dd667840cfeb9731569047aa6b31fef2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Sep 2024 18:14:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 287/913] stm32mp15 tree wide: use DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER_PM()

Replace DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER() directives with DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER_PM()
for resources that need to be unpaged for PM sequence support. This
change covers the resources used by generic core and stm32mp15
platforms.

Also add few keep.h inclusions that are missing.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git bfc962b446d7f18e49c08a6d3c0b916cc6a47752 stm32mp15 tree wide: use DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER_PM()
09284d2cf11f4ff12ce3b6209864634ee1a4bedf stm32mp15 tree wide: use DECLARE_KEEP_PAGER_PM() for MP15]
Change-Id: I4e847ab0a19e5b290b083ef8e0a5aa436b32840f
